---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Dr. Ramesh Kayyam" description="Meet Dr. Ramesh Kayyam—author, leadership scholar, speaker, educator, and the founder of Talkintree.">
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">About Dr. Ramesh Kayyam</p>
        <h1>A journey shaped by learning, responsibility, and purpose.</h1>
        <p>Author, leadership scholar, educator, and lifelong learner—committed to nurturing today and creating a better tomorrow.</p>
        <div class="hero-facts"><span>MBA</span><span>MSCS</span><span>Ph.D. in Leadership</span></div>
      </div>
      <figure class="portrait"><img src="/images/dr-ramesh-kayyam-portrait.png" alt="Portrait of Dr. Ramesh Kayyam"/><figcaption>Dr. Ramesh Kayyam</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="paper section roots">
    <div class="container roots-grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Where the journey began</p><h2 class="section-title">Roots in a small village. A vision for a better future.</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div></div>
      <div class="story-copy">
        <p>My journey began in a small village, working alongside my grandfather in the fields, caring for cattle and sheep, and going to school every day. Those early years taught me that hard work, love, and learning can grow together. The time I spent with my grandfather gave me strength that continues to guide me.</p>
        <p>When my family moved to a big city, life became more demanding. I learned to balance childhood, school, sports, friends, family responsibilities, and business. Whether helping my father bring water home, cooking for the family, or caring for my siblings, I learned that responsibility is not a burden when it is carried with love and care.</p>
        <p>After my father left our family, those responsibilities became even greater. I woke early to study and stayed up late to keep learning. Life moved quickly, but so did my determination—to support my family, to grow, and to contribute to society.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section journey">
    <div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">A life of learning</p><h2 class="section-title">Many chapters. One continuing purpose.</h2><div class="journey-grid">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>Creative beginnings</h3><p>I led cross-functional 3D animation teams of 60+ artists on global studio and internal projects, contributing to acclaimed productions including <em>Iron Man Adventures</em>, <em>The Jungle Book</em>, <em>Casper’s Scare School</em>, and <em>Mickey Mouse Clubhouse</em>.</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>Technology & business</h3><p>Across roles in network administration, project management, business development, business analysis, and AI training, I helped take projects from early analysis to successful outcomes that supported multimillion-dollar growth.</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>Education & mentoring</h3><p>As a Programs & Training Manager, I led curriculum development and training delivery across five regional centers, reaching more than 3,000 learners and supporting public-private partnerships for education and employment outcomes.</p></article>
      <article><span>04</span><h3>Leadership in everyday life</h3><p>Through thousands of rideshare conversations with people from more than 40 nationalities, I practiced servant leadership, empathy, and adaptive decision-making—turning everyday moments into trust, growth, and purpose.</p></article>
    </div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="paper section writer">
    <div class="container writer-grid">
      <div class="writer-label"><p class="eyebrow">Why I write</p><h2 class="section-title">Some stories are meant to be told.</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div><p>Stories can change the way we see, process, and live our own lives.</p></div>
      <div class="writer-copy"><p>My stories are rooted in the realities of our lives: our relationships, struggles, hopes, choices, and resilience. They begin by listening—to people, to their experiences, and to the human moments that often go unseen.</p><p>Through fiction and reflection, I hope to create work that helps readers feel understood, think differently, and recognize the possibility of change. Every story is simple, yet every journey can be profound.</p><a class="button dark-button" href="/books">Explore the books</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section philosophy">
    <div class="container philosophy-grid">
      <div class="philosophy-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A philosophy for change</p><h2 class="section-title">Pause. Reflect. Respond.</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div><p>Every situation may not be easy to assess, but reflection helps us choose our next step with clarity.</p></div>
      <div class="change-accept"><span>Change or accept</span><h3>Can I change this, or must I accept it?</h3><p>When a situation can be changed, we can respond with courage, learning, and purposeful action. When it cannot, acceptance can help us release unnecessary worry and move forward with peace. This practice is not always easy—but it is possible.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="impact paper section"><div class="container impact-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Recognition & contribution</p><h2 class="section-title">Growth becomes meaningful when it helps others grow.</h2></div><div><p>Dr. Ramesh Kayyam has been included in <em>Marquis Who’s Who in America</em> and received the Excellence in Animation Award (2009) for creative direction on <em>The Little Prince</em> project. He has mentored doctoral scholars toward completing their Ph.D. journeys and inspired hundreds of young people, business professionals, and leaders through education, coaching, and authentic conversation.</p><p class="mission">“Nurture today. Create a better tomorrow. Change begins with you.”</p><a class="button dark-button" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/drrameshkayyam" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Connect on LinkedIn ↗</a></div></div></section>

  <section class="invitation"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Continue the conversation</p><h2>Let’s create a better tomorrow—together.</h2><a class="button" href="/contact">Connect with Dr. Ramesh</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero{padding:9.5rem 0 5.5rem;background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%,#294530 0,#121312 46%,#0d0d0d 75%)}
  .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:7rem;align-items:center}.hero-copy h1{font-size:clamp(3.5rem,6.4vw,6rem);letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:1rem 0 1.45rem}.hero-copy>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:580px;color:#d3ccc0;font-size:1.12rem}.hero-facts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.65rem;margin-top:2.2rem}.hero-facts span{border:1px solid rgba(214,181,107,.5);padding:.45rem .65rem;color:var(--gold-light);font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.portrait{margin:0;position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5;background:#cfc5b3;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(214,181,107,.55)}.portrait:before{content:'';position:absolute;z-index:1;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 52%,rgba(13,13,13,.42));pointer-events:none}.portrait img{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top;filter:saturate(.87)}.portrait figcaption{position:absolute;z-index:2;bottom:0;left:0;margin:0;padding:.8rem 1rem;color:#111;background:var(--gold);font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .roots-grid,.writer-grid,.impact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:7rem}.story-copy{font-size:1.07rem;color:#58534b}.story-copy p:first-child,.writer-copy p:first-child,.impact-grid p:first-child{margin-top:0}.story-copy p{margin-bottom:1.45rem}
  .journey{background:#111}.journey-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);margin-top:3.5rem;border-top:1px solid rgba(214,181,107,.3);border-left:1px solid rgba(214,181,107,.3)}.journey-grid article{min-height:340px;padding:1.6rem;border-right:1px solid rgba(214,181,107,.3);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(214,181,107,.3);transition:background .25s ease,transform .25s ease}.journey-grid article:hover{background:#1c1c1b;transform:translateY(-5px)}.journey-grid span{font-size:.7rem;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:.1em}.journey-grid h3{font-size:1.65rem;margin:2.5rem 0 .65rem}.journey-grid p{color:#c4bdb2;font-size:.91rem;margin:0}.journey-grid em{font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic}
  .writer-label>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:440px;color:#5d574d}.writer-copy{color:#58534b;font-size:1.07rem}.writer-copy p{margin-bottom:1.45rem}.dark-button{background:var(--ink);color:var(--ivory);border-color:var(--ink);margin-top:.35rem}
  .philosophy{background:linear-gradient(115deg,#171717,#101713)}.philosophy-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7rem}.philosophy-heading>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:450px;color:#c7c0b6;font-size:1.02rem}.change-accept{border-left:1px solid rgba(214,181,107,.5);padding:1rem 0 1rem 2.2rem}.change-accept span{display:block;color:var(--gold);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.13em;font-size:.66rem;font-weight:700}.change-accept h3{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.7rem);margin:.75rem 0 1.2rem}.change-accept p{margin:0;color:#c8c1b6;font-size:1rem}
  .impact-grid>div:last-child{color:#58534b;font-size:1.06rem}.impact-grid p{margin-bottom:1.45rem}.impact-grid em{font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif}.impact-grid .mission{font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;color:#191817;font-size:1.55rem;line-height:1.3;border-left:3px solid var(--gold);padding-left:1.25rem;margin:2rem 0}
  .invitation{text-align:center;padding:6.3rem 1rem;background:var(--gold);color:var(--ink)}.invitation h2{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5.5vw,4.6rem);max-width:850px;margin:.7rem auto 1.75rem}.invitation .eyebrow{color:#5b461c}.invitation .button{background:#111;color:var(--ivory);border-color:#111}
  @media(max-width:850px){.hero-grid,.roots-grid,.writer-grid,.philosophy-grid,.impact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:3rem}.portrait{max-width:440px}.journey-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.about-hero{padding-top:8rem}}@media(max-width:540px){.journey-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.change-accept{padding-left:1.25rem}.hero-copy h1{font-size:3.4rem}}
</style>
